{
  "file" : "npc/cities/yuno.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "[Freidrich]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "^3355FFJuno^000000 is kept aloft in the air by an ancient and mysterious force."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "[Freidrich]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "This power is said to come from a relic from an ancient civilization called ^3355FFJuperos^000000 which existed here long before Juno."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "[Freidrich]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "Research revealed that Juno's power source based on ^3355FFPieces of Ymir's Heart^000000. I hear that this power source is found where Juperos used to exist."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "[Freidrich]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "Since many scholars have been coming to Juno to study and research this power source, our city is basically a well known mecca for scholars."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "[Freidrich]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "The city of Sages,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "^3355FFJuno,^000000 is made of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "three islands."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "[Freidrich]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "These are Solomon, the island of honor, Mineta, the island of prosperity, and Snotora, the island of knowledge."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "[Freidrich]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "The location of each island is"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "North-west : Solomon"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "North-east : Snotora"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Freidrich",
      "text" : "South : Mineta."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "[Granny]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "So, do you enjoy candy?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "^3355FFGranny hands you some candy^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "[Granny]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "You've already chosen. It doesn't matter whether or not you get this candy. That doesn't matter at all. You have to understand why it's happened."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "[Granny]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "Here's ^3355FF1,000 zeny^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "Do you accept this?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "Accept"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "Do not accept"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "[Granny]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "*Giggle*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "There you go~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "[Granny]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "*Giggle*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "Well then..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "See you ~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "[Granny]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "Yes, that's right. Now you must ask yourself why you didn't accept the candy I offered."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "*Giggle giggle*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "The time has come."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "Well then..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "I am an old Sage granny who foresees everything..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "[Granny]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "Have you heard of a boss monster that has been around Juno for a long time? It's known only as the ^FF3355Lord of the Dead^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "[Granny]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "It is rumored to be from the realm of the dead. It brings many undead monsters with it, intending to lead living creatures to its cold and icy realm."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "[Granny]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Juno Granny",
      "text" : "You have already chosen whether or not you will challenge the Lord of the Dead. All you need to do right now is understand why you made the decision."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Juno Fighter",
      "text" : "[Sergiof]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Juno Fighter",
      "text" : "My name is Sergiof,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Juno Fighter",
      "text" : "the fighter who"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Juno Fighter",
      "text" : "serves Granny."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Juno Fighter",
      "text" : "[Sergiof]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Juno Fighter",
      "text" : "I will tell you about ^3355FFGrand Peco^000000 which is a high level Peco Peco. Grand Peco is faster than Peco Peco and is quite aggressive."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Juno Fighter",
      "text" : "[Sergiof]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Juno Fighter",
      "text" : "It attacks using its strong bill and many Peco Pecos follow it. There's quite a difference in power between Peco Peco and the Grand Peco."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "text" : "[Ninno]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "text" : "You are very lucky to have me tell you this story. This only happens by ^FF33551 out of a 1,000 chance^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "text" : "[Ninno]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "text" : "This world you are experiencing is actually fabricated! It's time for you to see reality for what it is!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "text" : "[Ninno]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "text" : "Open your eyes! Stop being manipulated by virtual reality!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "text" : "Have you ever heard of an Egyptian king who was once believed to be a son of a god? His name is ^3355FFPharoah^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "text" : "[Ninno]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "text" : "He was rumored to be a high sorcerer that used his power to curse innocents. It is said that he is still around, placing his curses on people."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "text" : "[Ninno]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Juno Despot",
      "text" : "As an adventurer, it's possible that you may see him in your travels. Be careful..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "[Le Morpheus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "Look in my hand. I am holding two different kinds of herbs."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "[Le Morpheus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "One is a ^3355FFBlue Herb^000000 which will make you forget about reality and keep you in this virtual reality^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "[Le Morpheus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "The other is a ^FF3355Red Herb^000000 which will reveal to you what is true and real."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "[Le Morpheus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "Whichever one you choose, you must spend ^3355FF5,000 zeny^000000. Now, please select one."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "Choose ^FF3355Red Herb^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "Choose ^3355FFBlue Herb^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "[Le Morpheus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "As you have chosen, you will forget everything, and remain in this virtual reality."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "[Le Morpheus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "You will see the truth."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "Hmm. I'm sorry to say you just missed a fortunate chance. However, I can tell you don't have enough wealth to bring this fortune to fruition."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "^3355FFApocalypse^000000..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "It is the name of an android that used to guard Juno long ago."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "[Le Morpheus]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Juno Sage",
      "text" : "Because its artificial intelligence has corrupted over the years, it can no longer distinguish comrades from enemies. Sadly, that android is nothing but a mindless monster now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "[Artisan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "*Mumble mumble...*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "[Artisan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "Oh, hello there. Let me introduce myself. I am an artisan who tries to succeed the rights and duties of item makers in Juno."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "About Powerful Equipment"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "About Unique Items"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "About Authentic Food"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "End Conversation"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 210,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "[Artisan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 211,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "Let me suggest the ^3355FFHoly Guard^000000 and ^3355FFHoly Avenger^000000 which are special items for Crusaders."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 213,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "[Artisan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 214,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "These pieces of equipment are very light and have sufficient abilities. They also happen to possess holy power."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 216,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "[Artisan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 217,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "Therefore, this equipment is more powerful over some kinds of monsters such as Ghosts or the Undead."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 219,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "[Artisan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "However it is rumored that only a few chosen Crusaders are able to obtain those items due of their rarity."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "[Artisan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "It looks like a simple scroll marked with concentric circles and a star. Although the ^FF3355Worn-Out Magic Scroll^000000 is very old, it's wanted by many Sages for research purposes."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 226,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "[Artisan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 227,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "It seems you can use that item when you chant a high-level magic spell."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 230,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "[Artisan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 231,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "^3355FFRice Cake^000000! Yes, it's a traditional food that's favored by a lot of people. There's a lot of nostalgic memories of old fashioned markets that are connected to the Rice Cake."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 233,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "[Artisan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "Ahhh~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 235,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "I wish I could eat a bit of Rice Cake right now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 238,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "[Artisan]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 239,
      "npc" : "Juno Artisan",
      "text" : "Although Juno is known as a city of Sages, I hope you understand that ordinary people live and prosper here as well. Please enjoy the unique atmosphere that Juno has to offer."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 245,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 246,
      "text" : "Welcome to Juno, the city of noble-mindedness."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 248,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 249,
      "text" : "There is a monster near here known as Lava Golem. This golem is made from a stone heart whose power happened to be amplified with magic power when it was swept away by molten rock."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 251,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 252,
      "text" : "The lava dripping from its body is so hot that it can melt down armor and weapons made out of high quality steel."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 254,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 255,
      "text" : "You'd better be careful when you encounter this monster. It will damage armor and weapons in the twinkling of an eye."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 260,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 261,
      "text" : "Welcome to Juno, the city of noble-mindedness."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 263,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 264,
      "text" : "Geographer..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 265,
      "text" : "That monster looks like a flower blooming from the ground."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 267,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 268,
      "text" : "Strangely, it can extend its body a long distance. Even if you're far away from it, it can still pose a threat."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 270,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 271,
      "text" : "The name of this monster originated from a story about a poor geographer who, unfortunately, was eaten by this monster while he was immersed in his studies."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 276,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 277,
      "text" : "Welcome to Juno, the city of noble-mindedness."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 279,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 280,
      "text" : "Near Juno, there exists a fallen angel named 'False Angel.' It feigns innocence, pretending to bless adventurers and then stabbing them in the back without any warning."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 282,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 283,
      "text" : "Don't be fooled by its appearance, or you'll find yourself in trouble."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 288,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 289,
      "text" : "Welcome to Juno, the city of noble-mindedness."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 291,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 292,
      "text" : "'Goat' is a monster that was an antelope living in the high mountains that was somehow turned into a monster."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 294,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 295,
      "text" : "Even if you manage to dodge to its horns, you still need to be wary of its powerful legs."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 297,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 298,
      "text" : "Goat's legs are so strong because it's always climbing cliffs when it's not busy slaughtering the innocent."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 303,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 304,
      "text" : "Welcome to Juno, the city of noble-mindedness."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 306,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 307,
      "text" : "Have you ever"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 308,
      "text" : "seen a Large Jellopy?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 309,
      "text" : "Those things are huuuge!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 311,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 312,
      "text" : "It's hard to believe"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 313,
      "text" : "that such a large and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 314,
      "text" : "shining jellopy even exists!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 319,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 320,
      "text" : "Welcome to Juno, the city of noble-mindedness."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 323,
      "text" : "Among the Sage's weapons, there is a 'Dagger of Counter.'"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 326,
      "text" : "Its use is limited to the Sage class, and it increases the chance of inflicting critical attacks. So, for Sages, that dagger can be very useful, as well as make them look stylish in battle."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 331,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 332,
      "text" : "Welcome to Juno, the city of noble-mindedness."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 334,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 335,
      "text" : "There is a holy shield named 'Sacred Mission' which can only be used by Crusaders."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 337,
      "text" : "[Juno Soldier]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 338,
      "text" : "It's a long and narrow shield with an angel wing engraved in the center of the front side. Against Devil and Undead monsters, it is especially powerful."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 343,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "[Airship Representative]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 344,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "Good day, I am here to inform you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 345,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "about the Juno Airship which"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 346,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "we plan to operate in the near future."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 348,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "[Air ship Representative]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 349,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "Unfortunately, it is still in"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 350,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "development, and we've yet"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 351,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "to complete testing. However,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 352,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "we feel the need to let our"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 353,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "eager customers know of our"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 354,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "progress."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 356,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "[Airship Representative]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 357,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "The Airship we're developing will provide you with convenient travel to any town. You can also enjoy the sights while aloft in the sky. Unique products from various areas will also be provided."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 359,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "[Airship Representative]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 360,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "We promise our customers an"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 361,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "amazing travel experience"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 362,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "once the Airship is in"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 363,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "operation. In the meantime,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 364,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "we are providing a special"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 365,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "teleport service."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 367,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "[Airship Representative]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 368,
      "npc" : "Airship Representative",
      "text" : "The teleport fee is 1,800 zeny, regardless of where you want to go. Please let me know your desired destination."
    },
